arguments_prompt:
Arguments for kg_delete_node:

node_id (required): The UUID of the node you want to delete
confirm (optional): Set to true to bypass safety checks

Example (simple):
{
    "node_id": "abc-123-def-456"
}

Example (with confirmation):
{
    "node_id": "abc-123-def-456",
    "confirm": true
}
